ounded-square company mark is visually verified, not a default GitHub identicon.","language","en","获取方式","暂不可访问","access","section","源码","Full product source unavailable — No complete source release for the current hosted testing product was verified; older public samples are not its backend.","service","演示",[83],{"_61":84,"_25":85,"_86":87},"Book a product demo","https://modl.ai/contact","note","Commercial demonstration by arrangement; this is not a public playable game or instant sandbox.","教程",[90],{"_61":91,"_25":92,"_86":93},"Workflow overview","https://modl.ai/","Official upload, task-definition, and reporting overview; detailed onboarding is provided through the service.","来源核查","2026-10-18","verified","metadata","list","适用方向","ordered",false,[104,105],"dimensions","2D","3D","开发阶段",[109,110],"stages","测试验证","构建与发布","主题",[114,115,116,117],"tags","自动化实玩测试","Visual agents","Commercial service","Game QA","延伸阅读",[120],{"_61":121,"_25":85},"Request a product demonstration","项目源码",[124],{"_61":122,"_25":92},"用途与特点","当前服务观察屏幕并模拟输入，不要求引擎 SDK。团队上传构建、描述任务，再查看会话记录与缺陷报告。厂商声称覆盖 Android 与桌面，但对时序敏感的玩法有限制；也描述了利用测试数据进行游戏专用训练，因此无 SDK 不等于无需专门准备。它不同于旧版 SDK 文档，公开自助试玩、完整产品源码和独立实操教程仍需确认。","detail","guidance","资源类型","工具","分类","游戏制作","category","lead","summary","name","production","tool",[157],{"_149":150,"_151":152,"_32":153},[148,115,116,117],[146,147],[144,145],"2d","3d","test","ship","Automated playtesting","tutorial",{"_61":91,"_25":92,"_17":80,"_86":93},"demo",{"_61":84,"_25":85,"_17":80,"_86":87},{"_61":154,"_17":155,"_86":156},"Full product source unavailable","unavailable","No complete source release for the current hosted testing product was verified; older public samples are not its backend.",{"_61":121,"_25":85},{"_159":160},"documents",{"_73":161,"_35":162},[164,168,169,170,167,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,166,203,165,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,2